{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51810","headline":"春暮经石头城 · 陆蟾","name":"春暮经石头城","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"六朝多少事，搘肘思悠悠。\n落日空江上，子规啼渡头。\n蒹葭侵[坏]（废）垒，烟雾接沧洲。\n今古分明在，那堪向九秋？\n（以上《诗话总龟》十五引《雅言杂载》）（〖1〗北宋释契嵩《镡津文集》卷十三有《陆蟾传》，云蟾爲藤州镡津人，有王霸大略，以能诗名於楚越间，後客死於攸县司空山。\n又引高阆语称爲国初人。\n〖2〗《陆蟾传》所引，题作《瀑布咏》，「正源」作「灵源」，「浴」作「凝」，「射」作）（「溅」，「流」作「待」，「翻」作「爲」。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陆蟾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51810.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51810","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}